  "worksAsStation": false,
  "description": "A defender starts in front of the net, two forwards on that side, and a second defender at the red line. On the whistle, the coach spots a puck in the corner. The first defender gets it and passes up the wall. The forwards skate up, pass back to the defender at the red line, and get the puck back to attack 2-on-1 against the first defender, who has stepped up. Then the red-line defender goes back for the next puck and two new forwards go.",
